Subject: [PATCH] overlays: i2c-rtc: Fix README parameter alignment

Start the description on column 33.

Signed-off-by: Arthur Guilliman <auroraxq@protonmail.com>
---
 arch/arm/boot/dts/overlays/README | 6 ++++--
 1 file changed, 4 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

--- a/arch/arm/boot/dts/overlays/README
+++ b/arch/arm/boot/dts/overlays/README
@@ -2492,7 +2492,8 @@ Params: abx80x                  Select o
                                 and Vdd < Vddsw and Vbackup > Vddsw)
                                 (RV3028, RV3032)
 
-        quartz-load-femtofarads  Quartz load capacitance in femtofarads,
+        quartz-load-femtofarads
+                                Quartz load capacitance in femtofarads,
                                 7000 or 12500 (PCF85063, PCF85063A)
 
 
@@ -2577,7 +2578,8 @@ Params: abx80x                  Select o
                                 and Vdd < Vddsw and Vbackup > Vddsw)
                                 (RV3028, RV3032)
 
-        quartz-load-femtofarads  Quartz load capacitance in femtofarads,
+        quartz-load-femtofarads
+                                Quartz load capacitance in femtofarads,
                                 7000 or 12500 (PCF85063, PCF85063A)
 
         i2c_gpio_sda            GPIO used for I2C data (default "23")
